{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Platzle</strong> - is a puzzle platformer in which you not only have to act fast, but also think carefully. Cards give you new opportunities - collect them to get to the exit. Proceed with caution, as the locations hide many dangers - there are various natural phenomena such as lava and exploding flames, as well as monsters in the form of spiders and even HUGE bosses that will not be so easy to deal with! We believe that perseverance and dexterity will help you overcome all the challenges! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u>The game contains:</u></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">50 unique levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">7 unique ability cards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">5 unique bosses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Endless amounts of positive excitement</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3543970?t=1740167719","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3543970/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1740167719","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3543970/988350d9a25ef2e2c9ea0f53cfb0109602bb04dc/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1740167719","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3543970/988350d9a25ef2e2c9ea0f53cfb0109602bb04dc/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1740167719","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Platzle</strong> - is a puzzle platformer in which you not only have to act fast, but also think carefully. Cards give you new opportunities - collect them to get to the exit. Proceed with caution, as the locations hide many dangers - t